    icon: '🃏',
  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Capture**: Play a card from your hand. If its value matches a single card or the SUM of multiple cards on the table, you capture them.\n2. **Example**: A player plays a 7; they can take a 7 from the table, or a 4 and a 3, or a 5 and a 2.\n3. **Shokoba!**: If you capture ALL remaining cards on the table, you shout 'SHOKOBA!' and win 1 Gemstone immediately.",
    Player: "1. **Capture**: Play a card from your hand. If its value matches a single card or the SUM of multiple cards on the table, you capture them.\n2. **Example**: A player plays a 7; they can take a 7 from the table, or a 4 and a 3, or a 5 and a 2.\n3. **Shokoba!**: If you capture ALL remaining cards on the table, you shout 'SHOKOBA!' and win 1 Gemstone immediately.",
    objective: 'Score Gemstones by capturing table cards (by matching value or sum), by making a Shokoba (sweep) when you clear the table, and from end-of-round awards (most cards, most Coins/Diamonds, Settebello, Primiera). The first player or team to reach 11 Gemstones wins the game.',
    gameplay: "1. **Capture**: Play a card from your hand. If its value matches a single card or the SUM of multiple cards on the table, you capture them.\n2. **Example**: A player plays a 7; they can take a 7 from the table, or a 4 and a 3, or a 5 and a 2.\n3. **Shokoba!**: If you capture ALL remaining cards on the table, you shout 'SHOKOBA!' and win 1 Gemstone immediately.",
    keyRules: [
      'Capture by playing a card that matches one table card or the sum of several table cards; if both match, take the single card.',
      'When a capture is possible you must capture.',
      'Shokoba: clearing the entire table in one play scores 1 Gemstone.',
      'First to 11 Gemstones wins.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: false,
    trumpBonusValues: null,
    setup: {
      players: '2 players or 4 in teams.',
      deck: '40 cards. Ranks: 1 (Ace) to 10.',
      equipment: '40 cards. Ranks: 1 (Ace) to 10.',
      dealing: 'Each player receives 3 cards. 4 cards are placed face-up on the table. The deal is repeated until the deck is empty.',
    },
    turnFlow: "1. **Capture**: Play a card from your hand. If its value matches a single card or the SUM of multiple cards on the table, you capture them.\n2. **Example**: A player plays a 7; they can take a 7 from the table, or a 4 and a 3, or a 5 and a 2.\n3. **Shokoba!**: If you capture ALL remaining cards on the table, you shout 'SHOKOBA!' and win 1 Gemstone immediately.",
