    exampleHands: [
      'Setup example: 3 card(s) per player.',
      'Rule example: Score Gemstones by capturing table cards (by matching value or sum), by making a Shokoba (sweep) when you clear the table, and from end-of-round awards (most cards, most Coins/Diamonds, Settebello, Primiera). The first player or team to reach 11 Gemstones wins the game.',
      "Turn-flow example: 1. **Capture**: Play a card from your hand. If its value matches a single card or the SUM of multiple cards on the table, you capture them.\n2. **Example**: A player plays a 7; they can take a 7 from the table, or a 4 and a 3, or a 5 and a 2.\n3. **Shokoba!**: If you capture ALL remaining cards on the table, you shout 'SHOKOBA!' and win 1 Gemstone immediately.",
      'Scoring example: Be the first to collect 11 Gemstones (points). Points from Shokoba sweeps, most cards, most Diamonds/Coins, Settebello (7 of Coins), and Primiera. First player or team to reach 11 or more Gemstones wins..',
